    "product": {
      "id": 906536,
      "name": "White Russian Kale",
      "description": "<p>White Russian kale is a dark green, oak leaf-shaped kale with white stems that's great for cooking or eating raw. It's a popular variety that's disease resistant and has a sweet flavor that intensifies when cooked. Here are some more characteristics of White Russian kale:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Taste:White Russian kale has a crisp, sweet flavor that's considered by many to be the best tasting. Frost improves the flavor even more.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Appearance:White Russian kale has lightly frilled leaves with white veins and a gray-green base</p>\n<p>Preparation:White Russian kale can be blanched and used in soups, stews, casseroles, and side dishes.</p>",
